  "prefLabel": "He-E 502.06 Service Requests and Process",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-E 502.06 Service Requests and Process.\n\n(a) An individual or his or her authorized representative may request a Title III service(s) from any contract agency that provides the service(s) being requested, except that adult in-home care shall be requested from BAAS.\n\n(b) Individuals or their authorized representatives requesting Title III services shall be required to self-declare their age.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for He-E 502) #10530, eff 2-28-14; ss by #13354, eff 3-19-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-e500.html"
